@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p class="text-muted">Karnel Travel Guide respects your privacy. This page explains what information we collect and how we use it.</p>

<h4 class="mt-4">Information we collect</h4>
<p>
    When you register, contact us or send feedback, we collect the details you enter, such as your name,
    email address, phone number, country and message.
</p>

<h4 class="mt-4">How we use your information</h4>
<p>
    We use this information to create and manage your account, reply to your messages, improve our
    travel information and services, and handle your tour or transport requests.
</p>

<h4 class="mt-4">Sharing of information</h4>
<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to anyone.</p>

<h4 class="mt-4">Security</h4>
<p>
    Your password is stored in a protected (hashed) form and we take reasonable steps to keep your data safe.
</p>

<h4 class="mt-4">Contact us</h4>
<p>
    If you have any question about this policy, please use our
    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact page</a>.
</p>